/T (As you saw there are more than 1500 Registers that got optimized which is about the whole design when we looked at the reasons we found that some got merged after we picked the most accurate 16 bits and some are lost due to fanout meaning they are connected to output but you didnt use this output and that is logical becuase you use the output of the adder not the Z block)
/E (As you saw there are more than 1500 Registers that got optimized which is about the whole design when we looked at the reasons we found that some got merged after we picked the most accurate 16 bits and some are lost due to fanout meaning they are connected to output but you didnt use this output and that is logical becuase you use the output of the adder not the Z block)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [1]
>>
